cloud-based system, and sends a copy to decoupled off-cloud storage. These 
digital records won’t just be an IT backup of the cloud platform but will be 
stored in an product-agnostic standardised form, using the Oxford Common File 
Layout, and with each file accompanied by an up-to-date copy of all the 
metadata describing the record. This Custodial Copy is intended to be a fully 
