https://www.nature.com/articles/116635a0\n\n[4] The Pseudo-Minoan Nestor Ring 
and Its Egyptian Iconography |\nJournal of Ancient Egyptian Interconnections 
https://journals.librarypublishing.arizona.edu/jaei/article/id/960\n\n[6] 
(2020) A. G. Vlachopoulos, “The Ring of Nestor and the quest for authenticity”,
in F. Blakolmer (ed.) Current Approaches and New Perspectives in Aegean 
Iconography, Aegis 18 (2020), pp. 223-252. 
https://www.academia.edu/43416584/_2020_A_G_Vlachopoulos_The_Ring_of_Nestor_and
_the_quest_for_authenticity_in_F_Blakolmer_ed_Current_Approaches_and_New_Perspe
ctives_in_Aegean_Iconography_Aegis_18_2020_pp_223_252\n\n[9] Corpus der 
